@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title 登录时序图
actor "用户" as U
participant "LoginFrame" as UI
participant "AuthServiceImpl" as A
participant "UserRepositoryImpl" as R
participant "PasswordUtil" as P
participant "OperationLog\nRepositoryImpl" as L
database "SQLite" as DB
== 认证成功路径 ==
U -> UI : 输入账号、密码并点击登录
UI -> A : login(username, rawPassword)
A -> A : 校验输入格式与非空
A -> R : findByUsername(name)
R -> DB : 参数化查询users
DB --> R : 返回记录
R --> A : Optional<User>
A -> A : 检查user.isEnabled()
A -> P : verify(password, salt, hash)
P --> A : true
A -> L : insert(登录日志)
L -> DB : INSERT operation_logs
A --> UI : 返回User
UI -> UI : 设置当前用户并打开MainFrame
note over UI,DB
输入不合法：ValidationException；账号不存在或密码错误：AuthenticationException；停用账号单独提示。
错误由UiUtils.showError展示并保留登录窗口；账号查询和密码检查由AuthServiceImpl执行。
当前登录日志采用尽力写入：失败记warning，认证结果不因日志写入失败而回滚。
end note
@enduml
